WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.875
To sum up.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:03.875
You checked the sensor version
that contain user needs.

3
00:00:03.875 --> 00:00:06.539
You compared the device
group levels and the attack

4
00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:09.450
disruption exclusions with
the ladder decision record.

5
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.414
You ran the monthly evidence run,

6
00:00:11.414 --> 00:00:14.687
and you checked its hashes
the way next month's run will.

7
00:00:14.687 --> 00:00:17.373
The evidence an I S S O
keeps from this module:

8
00:00:17.373 --> 00:00:20.507
the device group list with
each remediation level,

9
00:00:20.507 --> 00:00:25.654
the attack disruption exclusions with
their approvals, the monthly Action center

10
00:00:25.654 --> 00:00:28.041
export, the quarterly exercise record,

11
00:00:28.041 --> 00:00:30.950
and the monthly package
with its checksum file.

12
00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:32.825
That completes the learning path.

13
00:00:32.825 --> 00:00:37.334
From here, work the implementation
guide's checklist, gate by gate,

14
00:00:37.334 --> 00:00:40.925
from one to ten, and keep
the evidence each gate names.

15
00:00:40.925 --> 00:00:45.410
Thank you for following Defender
X D R Engineering and Operations.
